 },
 "summary": "Single silicon Zener diodes in the three-lead SOT-23 package, rated 250 mW on an FR-5 board and 300 mW on alumina. The C series runs from 2.4 V to 75 V in the standard tolerance; the B series is a tighter-tolerance set from 3.3 V to 27 V. SZ-prefix versions are AEC-Q101 qualified and PPAP capable. BZX84C12LT1G is the 12 V standard-tolerance type: 11.4 V to 12.7 V at 5 mA, marking Y2.",
